{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，灣仔警區特別職務隊聯同入境處，根據線報及深入調查後，昨日（26日）下午在區內展開代號「虎尾」的掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東及駱克道多個樓上單位。執法人員共拘捕10名內地女子，年齡介乎16歲至45歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」，所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由入境處跟進。</p><p>據了解，所有被捕女子持雙程證入境。</p><figure><img alt=\"多名涉案女子被捕。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202839703590539264350816.jpeg/MmLWPFYXDJpe5jmqzJOu12A3-HEc3aAn8M0BQvDNAUI\"/><figcaption>多名涉案女子被捕。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:44:18.696500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:25:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:41:48.207839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:37:48.493725+00:00","content_hash":"d4dbb89e3b848033983bfcf40459f842aca4b0dc2a5dfc9ca7810b4cfd500262","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}